			"Message": "feat(Sky): Add VS Code terminal and language detection\n\nAdd @xterm/xterm with all addon packages and @vscode/vscode-languagedetection to dependencies. Update astro.config.ts build step to copy these node_modules to Static/Application/node_modules/ for runtime access.\n\nThese packages enable the VS Code workbench to provide terminal emulation via xterm.js and language detection functionality, delivering full VS Code feature parity in the Land editor.",
